Subject: [PATCH 1/3] genpolicy: Allow a pids limit in CreateContainer requests

The pids block is about to be forwarded to the guest like the CPU and
memory blocks are. Stop requiring it to be null, so that a container
with an OCI pids limit is still admitted by the default policy.

